<title>SOUTH AFRICA: S.Africa gold index losses top 5 percent.</title>
<headline>S.Africa gold index losses top 5 percent.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa's all gold index shed 5.07 percent, or 48.3 points, to stand at 903.8 by 1228 GMT on Monday as the bullion price continued its recent slide.</p>
</text>
